save_

save_CSP

    _definition.id                CSP
    _definition.scope             Category
    _definition.class             Set
    _definition.update            2026-08-20
    _description.text
;
    The CSP category covers data on CSP input definition, structure generation methods and data blocks organisation
    (the CSP workflow). Single energy methods and output structures parameters are excluded as they could be used
    for general computational chemistry calculations.
;
    _name.category_id             CIF_CSP_HEAD
    _name.object_id               CSP
    
save_

